icle/look-out-for-casting-scams-935k5-cesct-89g2a-6t4f4-999xd-ywpzy\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d102\"},\"ref\":\"d102\",\"snippet\":\" ... It has been almost 27 years and I am still running around in circles for the court case. I tried my best for an outside-court settlement but it could not happen. This man is not even ready to respect the court's verdict. The established amount (that ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.indiatoday.in/movies/celebrities/story/suneel-darshan-on-26-year-feud-with-sunny-deol-he-owes-me-rs-7725-lakh-2429214-2023-08-31\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1a9703a0cdbd58c31474c112532726a3a9593f7a9ecc07e7f6d459d0841f1dcb\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"88fbf26d914aaa1514580647b819a903158634649994f11c50013aaadaebc134\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"I am perfectly formed actor interview\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d103\"},\"ref\":\"d103\",\"snippet\":\" ... New Order\\n\\nA fresh Melbourne International Comedy Festival showcase of rising British talent featuring Amy Annette, Emmanuel Sonubi, and Paddy Young. This curated selection represents the next wave of UK comedy, each bringing their unique perspective on modern British life.\\n\\nConfetti and Chaos\\n\\nWill and Stacey are getting ... \",\"title\":\"https://beat.com.au/melbourne-international-comedy-festival-the-best-shows-to-see-in-2025/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"s